## What We Are Building

Two arcs this session:

1. **Master merge + worktree cleanup (done early):** squash-merged the TD-72→TD-86 batch to master via a fresh clean branch (PR #25), closed the conflicting PR #24, deleted 8 dead worktrees, handed the TD-85↔master rebase conflict back to the `tender-aryabhata` session. TD-85 itself merged via PR #26 (`072194e`).

2. **Distribution-tail fix pack (main work, branch `feat/distribution-tail`):** after montage (EXEC-STITCH→VID-final_cut) the packaging tail was immature. Built:
   - **Preview resolver fix (Phase 1):** one shared `resolvePreviewSrc` util; all preview surfaces (AssetPreview Image/Video/Audio bodies + 3 drawers) route through it.
   - **EXEC-THUMB-DESIGNER (new LLM agent) + `viral-thumbnail-design` skill:** authors `SPC-thumb_plan` with N viral concepts (default 3, cap 10) from Bible canon + CTR craft.
   - **EXEC-THUMB renderer:** renders the approved plan into N sibling IMG-thumbnail variants. (Originally gpt-image-1; swapped to Ideogram v3 on fal mid-session.)
   - **Publish gate:** now requires approved `VID-final_cut` (not animatic); final-cut approve/revision wired.
   - **Durable media serving:** `/api/media/[id]` route serving from a worktree-independent cache (fixes the staging incident — see below).

Goal of S15-E01: validate the Mode 2.5 (Apprentice) pipeline end-to-end including the rebuilt distribution tail, as the bridge to Mode 3.

