## Decisions Made

- **Merge via diff-squash** (PR #25), not the conflicting PR #24 (duplicated history). PR #24 closed superseded.
- **Thumbnail = LLM agent + skill** (not dumb code) — Director invoked train-personnel doctrine. Plan-first: DESIGNER→plan→Director approve→renderer.
- **Provider: multi-canon gpt-image-edit (EREF's), NOT Ideogram** — Ideogram single-ref lost canon; multi-canon holds Sandy+props. Text via overlay compositor. (Reverses the mid-session Ideogram choice.)
- **Cache mirrors Drive folder structure** under C:\SandyStudio (3-tier §2; findability).
- **Publish gate → VID-final_cut** (animatic was a latent bug; Director confirmed).
- **Sequence to Mode 3:** fix thumbnail quality → finish S15-E01 to publish (graduation proof) → THEN Mode 3 on next episode. Not both at once.
- **Durable media serving** over fragile worktree `/staging` symlinks.

